<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Patch>

  <!--
    Re-point the two Jawa pawn kinds at MandrakeJawa (owner ruling 2026-08-14: it is the ONLY active Jawa xenotype) instead of
    OuterRim_Jawa (+10 C). Owner ruled; gate W2.

    🔴 THIS IS A WORLDGEN GATE, NOT A TUNING PATCH. xenotypeSet is read at PAWN
    GENERATION, so a patch landing after a world exists does not fix that world's
    colonists — you get a campaign whose Jawas are quietly the wrong xenotype on a
    desert planet, and nothing errors. It has to be in the load that makes the
    world.

    WHAT IT TOUCHES. Two PawnKindDefs from Outer Rim - Galactic Diversity
    (ws 2980427615, 1.6/Defs/GeneDefs/Xenotype_Jawa.xml:28-46):

        OuterRim_Jawa        ParentName OuterRimTestColonyPawnKind
        OuterRim_JawaTribal  ParentName OuterRimTestTribalPawnKind

    Both carry exactly:

        <xenotypeSet><xenotypeChances><OuterRim_Jawa>999</OuterRim_Jawa></xenotypeChances></xenotypeSet>

    ⚠️ THE XENOTYPE IS THE ELEMENT NAME, NOT A VALUE. `xenotypeChances` is a
    def-keyed dictionary — <OuterRim_Jawa>999</OuterRim_Jawa> means "this
    xenotype, this weight". So there is no text node to edit: the whole
    xenotypeChances block is replaced. A PatchOperationReplace aimed at a
    <li> or at a value would match nothing here.

    ⚠️ Three mods define a Jawa xenotype (Galactic Diversity, BTD Xenotype REMIX,
    guy762 Star Wars Xenotypes) and generation rolls whichever these kinds name.
    This patch settles ONLY these two kinds; it does not deduplicate the
    xenotypes themselves, which is a separate and much larger ruling.

    LOAD ORDER: Jawa_Patches declares loadAfter Neronix17.OuterRim.GalacticDiversity,
    so this lands after the defs it edits. Without that the xpath matches nothing
    and fails silently.

    Conditional so a donor restructure degrades to a no-op rather than an error.
  -->

  <Operation Class="PatchOperationConditional">
    <xpath>/Defs/PawnKindDef[defName="OuterRim_Jawa"]/xenotypeSet/xenotypeChances/OuterRim_Jawa</xpath>
    <match Class="PatchOperationReplace">
      <xpath>/Defs/PawnKindDef[defName="OuterRim_Jawa"]/xenotypeSet/xenotypeChances</xpath>
      <value>
        <xenotypeChances>
          <MandrakeJawa>999</MandrakeJawa>
        </xenotypeChances>
      </value>
    </match>
  </Operation>

  <Operation Class="PatchOperationConditional">
    <xpath>/Defs/PawnKindDef[defName="OuterRim_JawaTribal"]/xenotypeSet/xenotypeChances/OuterRim_Jawa</xpath>
    <match Class="PatchOperationReplace">
      <xpath>/Defs/PawnKindDef[defName="OuterRim_JawaTribal"]/xenotypeSet/xenotypeChances</xpath>
      <value>
        <xenotypeChances>
          <MandrakeJawa>999</MandrakeJawa>
        </xenotypeChances>
      </value>
    </match>
  </Operation>

</Patch>
